flowchart LR
  U[Class member in browser\nHTML · CSS · JavaScript]
  REST[JSON REST requests\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT]
  API[Express API\nvalidation · auth · errors]
  DB[(SQLite database\nusers · tasks)]
  WS[Socket.IO server\nJWT handshake]
  ROOM[Shared classroom room\nClass 04 · Web Tech]
  EVENTS[Live JSON events\ntask:created · updated · deleted]
  U --> REST --> API --> DB
  API -->|persist then emit| WS
  U <-->|authenticated WebSocket| WS
  WS --> ROOM --> EVENTS --> U
  API -->|JSON error response| U
